              <div x-show="openAccordion === 1" x-transition class="px-5 pb-5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 space-y-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-amber-900">
                  <strong class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-950 mb-1">
                    <span>⚡</span> Luật RÚT – BẤM – KHAY (Quy tắc sống còn):
